Package: susolisting
Title: 'Shiny' Application for Enumeration Area Listing on Satellite Imagery
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Wild", , "mwild@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive 'Shiny' application to mark buildings on 'Google Maps'
    or 'Vantor' ('Maxar') satellite imagery within user-provided enumeration
    area (EA) boundaries. Reads boundary polygons in 'ESRI' shapefile format,
    exports listed building coordinates as a CSV file, supports second-stage
    spatially balanced sampling via 'spsurvey', and integrates with
    'Survey Solutions' (<https://mysurvey.solutions/>) via
    'SurveySolutionsAPIv2' for automated survey assignment creation.
